<title>UK: Brammer yr pretax profit up 31 pct.</title>
<headline>Brammer yr pretax profit up 31 pct.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, March 24 Reuter) - Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		40.7		   vs 31.5</p>
<p> Final dividend	   10.75		  vs n/a</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 16.00		  vs 14.25</p>
<p> Pretax		     28.2		   vs 21.6</p>
<p> Turnover		   205		    vs 183</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the British industrial services group iS Brammer Plc. The company said results in the first two months of 1997 were higher than a year earlier but warned market conditions had become more difficult. Brammer said it expected growth this year but at a lower rate than the past three years.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
